E AX3073 1004-undeclared-unsafe.ax:16:13-20 undeclared-unsafe "`main` touches raw memory and its declaration does not say so" #"__alloc" ?15:1:"write `;@axiom:effect(unsafe)` above the declaration"~>";@axiom:effect(unsafe)\n" ?"this fires where the unsafe operation is performed, not up the call chain. The tag makes the declaration a trusted encapsulation, whose callers inherit nothing. If the operation is not wanted here the fix is to stop performing it, not to stop saying so"
